            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu fonksiyonun içinde gruplamak için iki boşluk girintileriz. Bu fonksiyon, birbiriyle ilişkili iki <code>print()</code> ifadesini gruplar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome back&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>print</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu bir fonksiyonda gruplamak için iki boşluk girintile.</p><p>İki <code>print()</code> ifadesini grupla. Önce <code>Good morning Anna</code>, ardından <code>Welcome back</code> göster.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome back&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Good morning Anna&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Welcome back&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print(\"Good morning Anna\")</code>, ardından <code>print(\"Welcome back\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Functions",
            "id": 79928,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu çalıştırmak için fonksiyonu <strong>çağırmamız</strong> gerekir. Bunu, adını parantezlerle birlikte kodlayarak yaparız; örneğin <code>greet_user()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome back&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_user()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"83\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning Anna\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Welcome back\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>greet_user()</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
