            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyona snake case biçiminde bir ad ver.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"night_routine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alarm set&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"night_routine()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"nightroutine\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alarm set\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>night_routine</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hem tanımda hem çağrıda sırayla ayrı <code>night</code> ve <code>routine</code> sözcüklerini snake case biçiminde kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"night_routine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alarm set&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"night_routine()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"nightroutine\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alarm set\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>night_routine</code>, ardından <code>night_routine</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
